# Env files at ANY depth — never ship dev/secret env into images.
# Runtime env is provided by docker-compose; build-time NEXT_PUBLIC_* come
# from build ARGs. Shipping e.g. apps/vionto/.env bakes dev values
# (REDIS_URL=localhost:6380) that override the correct runtime env.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Age keys / encrypted env — must never be inside images
.age
**/.age

*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

*.local
*.tmp
tmp
temp

ASafariM.session.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

docs
uptime-kuma
